<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average lost 19.75 to 6422.94.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.62 to 393.23.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.17.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1426 to 1041.</p>
<p>Volume was 493,701,070, compared with 515,647,480 Tuesday.</p>
